          "text": "Low back pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Chronic for years, increased over the last 6–9 months with extra aged-care shifts and manual handling. Aching, sometimes sharp with bending or lifting; worse at end of day and after double shifts. Baseline 3–4/10, flares to 7/10. No injury."
